    <S id="028S2">
        <FORM kindOf="original">qau qepuin a tsuqelaɫ nua vavuy, sa kisenay: "kasan ḍiḍi-u, kasan ḍiḍi-u," sa ayain azua tsuqelaɫ.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="original">qau qəpuin a ʦuqəɭaʎ nua vavuj sa kisənaj kasan ɖiɖiu kasan ɖiɖiu sa ajain azua ʦuqəɭaʎ</PHON>
        <FORM kindOf="standard">qau qepuin a cuqelalj nua vavuy, sa kisenay: "kasan dridri-u, kasan dridri-u," sa ayain azua cuqelalj.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="standard">qau qəpuin a ʦuqəɣaʎ nua vavuj sa kisənaj kasan ɖiɖiu kasan ɖiɖiu sa ajain azua ʦuqəɣaʎ</PHON>
        <TRANSL xml:lang="eng">The bones of wild pigs were collected, and a chant of blessing was sung over the bones: "Become pigs, become pigs!".</TRANSL>
